# SALGIN alone, a loss: no key at all. The opponent attacks every 7 or 8
# beats (about 1.5 s) and the 90-s clock ends the round with the player's
# energy lower: the opponent wins and the game closes when mane.WAV ends
# (BUGS.md S6), 92640 ms (Original) or 104040 ms (`--fix all`: the fair
# fight, below).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame salgin --headless --ms 100000 --input tools/play/salgin-alone-lose.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame salgin --headless --ms 110000 --fix all --input tools/play/salgin-alone-lose.input
# The Corrigida (`--fix all`) shows SALGIN's controls screen first; Enter takes
# it down 50 ms after it opened, PORRADA stands for 2 s (the frozen intro,
# `fight_controls.start_delay_ms`) and the round then plays as the
# Original's from its start, 2050 ms later (`delay`: every later line
# moves too).
50 ?fight_controls_screen key return
50 ?fight_controls_screen delay 2050
30000 dump fight
90000 dump lost
